File explanation:

`data_inspection.ipynb`: shows the entire process of cleaning original deepbeat data (drop duplicates with different labels, etc), and updating it with relabeled data

`pytorch\deepbeat_model.py` : deepbeat equivalent in pytorch

`pytorch/inspect_model.ipynb`: prints out total parameters and output of each layer of pytorch deepbeat model, and compares it with tensorflow model

`pytorch\params_tuning_f1.py`: Baysian Optimization with Optuna by maximizing f1 score

`pytorch\train_pytorch_model.py`: Model Training Script



